### Phase 3 — Booking through the Gateway

### Public catalog (no JWT)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/bookings/hotels

### Rooms for hotel 1
GET http://localhost:8080/api/bookings/hotels/1/rooms

### Availability
GET http://localhost:8080/api/bookings/rooms/1/availability?checkIn=2026-09-10&checkOut=2026-09-12

### Create booking (CUSTOMER token)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/bookings
Authorization: Bearer TOKEN
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "roomId": 1,
  "checkIn": "2026-09-10",
  "checkOut": "2026-09-12"
}

### My bookings
GET http://localhost:8080/api/bookings/my
Authorization: Bearer TOKEN

### Confirm booking
POST http://localhost:8080/api/bookings/1/confirm
Authorization: Bearer TOKEN

### Mock payment confirm
POST http://localhost:8080/api/bookings/1/payment/confirm
Authorization: Bearer TOKEN

### Cancel booking (frees the dates)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/bookings/1/cancel
Authorization: Bearer TOKEN

### Admin: hotel bookings
GET http://localhost:8080/api/bookings/hotel/1
Authorization: Bearer ADMIN_TOKEN

### Customer creating a hotel — expect 403
POST http://localhost:8080/api/bookings/hotels
Authorization: Bearer CUSTOMER_TOKEN
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Should Fail",
  "city": "Hyderabad"
}
